  - m_Id: 34954398777426
    m_Localized: Brawn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34954398777427
    m_Localized: Raw strength. Carry weight, melee damage, heavy weapons, a little
      health.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34954398777428
    m_Localized: Senses
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34954398777429
    m_Localized: Sight, hearing, instinct. Weapon range, spotting traps and hidden
      things, noticing what others miss.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34954398777430
    m_Localized: Grit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34954398777431
    m_Localized: Toughness and stamina. Health, healing, resistance to radiation
      and poison, long marches.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34954398777432
    m_Localized: Presence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34954398777433
    m_Localized: Force of personality. How people react to you, prices, followers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34954398777434
    m_Localized: Wits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34954398777435
    m_Localized: Intelligence and memory. Skill points, science and medicine, seeing
      through lies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34954398777436
    m_Localized: Reflex
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34954398777437
    m_Localized: Speed and coordination. Action points, initiative, firearms, stealth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34954398777438
    m_Localized: Fortune
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34954398777439
    m_Localized: The world bending your way. Critical hits, odd encounters, finds,
      gambling.
